() Tj T*
(456:2000.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(\(a\) All plain and reinforced concrete work shall conform to IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(\(b\) All RCC work shall be of grade M30.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Nominal cover to reinforcement shall be 45mm. The free water-cement ratio shall not exceed) Tj T*
(0.45.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Minimum cement content shall be 320 kg/m³.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Cement shall be ordinary Portland cement 43 grade conforming to IS 269:2015.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Coarse and fine aggregates shall conform to IS 383:2016.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Reinforcement shall be Fe 500D TMT bars conforming to IS 1786:2008. Concrete shall be) Tj T*
(design mix proportioned as per IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(\(h\) Curing shall be continued for a minimum period of 10 days.) Tj T*
(\(i\) Concrete shall be compacted with mechanical needle vibrators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — STRUCTURAL STEEL WORK) Tj T*
(\(a\) Structural steel sections and plates shall be of grade E250 conforming to IS 2062:2011.) Tj T*
(\(b\) ALL STEEL WORK SHALL RECEIVE ONE COAT OF ZINC CHROMATE PRIMER AND TWO COATS OF ENAMEL) Tj T*
(PAINT.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Fabrication and erection shall be carried out as per the approved drawings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 6: INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(\(a\) Wiring shall be carried out as per IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The supply system shall be TN-S earthing arrangement.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Wiring shall be concealed in rigid PVC conduits of 1.5mm wall thickness. Wires shall be FR) Tj T*
(PVC insulated, single core, stranded copper conductor of 450/750 V grade conforming to IS) Tj T*
(694:2010.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Lighting circuits shall be wired with 1.5 sq mm and power circuits with 4 sq mm copper) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
