(7 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Compressive strength tests shall be carried out as per IS 516 \(Part 1/Sec 1\):2021.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Manufacturer's test certificates shall be furnished for each lot of cement and) Tj T*
(reinforcement steel. Mill test certificates shall be submitted for all structural steel.) Tj T*
(\(c\) On completion, insulation resistance and earth continuity tests shall be carried out in) Tj T*
(accordance with IS 732. Wires, MCBs and RCCBs shall be ISI marked.) Tj T*
(\(d\) The equipment shall be inspected by the Engineer-in-charge at the manufacturer's works) Tj T*
(before dispatch.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(\(a\) The contractor shall submit detailed shop drawings for approval within 21 days of award of) Tj T*
(work.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Three sets of operation and maintenance manuals shall be handed over on completion.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The complete installation shall be guaranteed against defective design, material and) Tj T*
(workmanship for a period of 12 months from the date of handing over.) Tj T*
